message: "If you refer to this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "SecondSignal: a model-agnostic routing and safety policy layer for a seven-voice AI assistant"
abstract: "The policy layer of SecondSignal: a deterministic routing tree with seat-claims, holds and obligations, a fail-closed crisis screen over normalized text, a two-tier careful-side latch, and a machine-checked register of architecture decisions, with an evaluation program of labelled fixtures from external model reviewers kept verbatim as passes, contract adjustments, recorded dissents and known gaps."
type: software
